  "description": "JOYSTAR Contender 20\" Full Dual-Suspension MTB\nConquer the trails with the JOYSTAR Contender 20\" Kids Mountain Bike. Designed for young riders ready to take on diverse terrain, this bike combines a rugged aesthetic with high-performance dual suspension for ultimate control and comfort.\n\nAdventure awaits: The 20\" Contender in Black & Green.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Built for rugged trails and neighborhood paths, the Contender's dual suspension system absorbs the bumps so your child can focus on the ride.\"\nSuperior Shock Absorption\nThe JOYSTAR Contender features a dual-suspension steel frame. The combination of a front suspension fork and a rear spring shock helps absorb bumps and vibrations, providing a smoother ride on tough trails and improving overall traction.\n\nFront and rear suspension for controlled riding on any surface.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nDual Handbrakes: Equipped with front and rear alloy linear-pull brakes (V-brakes) for secure, reliable stopping power.\n\nAll-Terrain Tires: Wide 2.125\" pneumatic tires provide the aggressive grip and stability needed for trail riding.\n\nSingle-Speed Drivetrain: Simplifies riding, allowing kids to focus on handling and balance without the complexity of gears.\n\nAdjustable Fit: Features a tool-free adjustable saddle and seat post to grow alongside your child.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nGet riding faster with JOYSTAR. The Contender arrives 85% pre-assembled. All necessary components and instructions are included to make the final setup quick and straightforward.\n\nAssembly Guide: Step-by-step instructions for your JOYSTAR Contender.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Action\n\nWatch: Exploring trails and neighborhood paths with the JOYSTAR Contender.\n\nOur Guarantee\nJOYSTAR is committed to quality and durability. We provide a robust warranty to ensure your peace of mind:\n\nLifetime Frame Warranty: Our steel frames are guaranteed for as long as the original owner keeps the bike.\n\nSupport: Dedicated customer service to help with assembly, maintenance, or replacement parts.",
